        <detaileddescription>
<para>Layout: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">|[--<sp/>VISUAL<sp/>--]<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>^labelBg<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>^barBg<sp/>(fills<sp/>rest<sp/>of<sp/>width)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Fill entire bounds with <computeroutput><ref refid="class_status_bar_overlay_1a1b8e43fdf96727d8ea5b92e3dd5cb3fead7e7e03e80caa298c7bf975a467c5102" kindref="member">barBackgroundColourId</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Measure text width of the mode label.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fill a rectangle of (text width + 2 * labelPadding) on the left with <computeroutput><ref refid="class_status_bar_overlay_1a1b8e43fdf96727d8ea5b92e3dd5cb3fea38fa2a112c411626975684b7f3f78416" kindref="member">labelBackgroundColourId</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Draw the label text centred within that rectangle using <computeroutput><ref refid="class_status_bar_overlay_1a1b8e43fdf96727d8ea5b92e3dd5cb3feafaa088b633bd2b31155e97c91a0106b8" kindref="member">labelTextColourId</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
